Read the command from USB (the C 
line)
Apply the outputs: LEDs, buzzer, fan 
relay, LCD
Tell the phone if the level changed 
(HC-05) repeat
E V E R Y 1 S E C O N D
Read the 3 sensors (average 
of 5 samples each) Send the D line to Python Python silent for 5 
s?
Local rule: alarm if smoke or 
flame is high
Yes
No: keep following Python's command
The fail-safe means the alarm still works if the laptop is switched off or unplugged.
