Testing plan and what comes next
Test case Sensors high Expected level
Normal air none SAFE
Cooking-like smoke only smoke WARNING
Strong light on flame sensor flame WARNING
Hot room temperature WARNING
Smoke and flame smoke, flame POSSIBLE FIRE
Smoke, flame and heat all three FIRE DETECTED
H O W W E M E AS U R E
Detection accuracy = correct detections ÷ total tests ×
100
False-alarm rate = false alarms ÷ total tests × 100
Compare single-sensor logic with combined logic 
using the CSV log.
